@page "/generator"
<PageTitle>Generator</PageTitle>


<div class="card slide-up mb-4 p-3" style="animation-delay:.35s;">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-start align-items-center mb-3">
        <h5 class="card-title mb-0" style="font-family:var(--cu-font-cyber); color:var(--cu-text);
            text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px; font-size:0.9rem;">
            Tabs &amp; Pills
        </h5>
        <small class="text-muted" style="font-family:var(--cu-font-cyber); color:var(--cu-muted) !important;"> glitch</small>
    </div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-4">

        <div>
            <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="myTab" role="tablist">
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link active" id="tab1-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab"
                            data-bs-target="#tab1" type="button" role="tab">
                        SQL Connection
                    </button>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="tab2-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab2"
                            type="button" role="tab">
                        Schema
                    </button>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="tab3-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab"
                            data-bs-target="#tab3" type="button" role="tab">
                        AI schema assistant
                    </button>

                </li>

                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="tab4-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab"
                            data-bs-target="#tab4" type="button" role="tab">
                        AI naming & documentation
                    </button>

                </li>

                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="tab5-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab"
                            data-bs-target="#tab5" type="button" role="tab">
                        Implicit relationships
                    </button>

                </li>

                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="tab6-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab"
                            data-bs-target="#tab6" type="button" role="tab">
                        Generate
                    </button>

                </li>

                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="tab7-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab"
                            data-bs-target="#tab7" type="button" role="tab">
                        Results
                    </button>

                </li>

            </ul>
            <div class="tab-content pt-3">
                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tab1" role="tabpanel">
                    <p><span style="color:var(--cu-neon-cyan); font-weight:600;">SQL Server connection string</span> — This panel has a neon glow.</p>
                    <p class="text-muted">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</p>
                    <MudSelect T="Guid" Variant=" MudBlazor.Variant.Outlined" Dense="true" Margin="Margin.Dense">
                        <MudSelectItem Value="Guid.Empty">TEST</MudSelectItem>

                    </MudSelect>
                    <MudInput T="string" Variant="MudBlazor.Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense"></MudInput>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab2" role="tabpanel">
                    <p><span style="color:var(--cu-neon-cyan); font-weight:600;">Choose tables , Views and Stored Procedures</span> — More info here.</p>
                    <ul class="text-muted"><li>Item one</li><li>Item two</li></ul>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab3" role="tabpanel">
                    <p><span style="color:var(--cu-neon-cyan); font-weight:600;">Ask questions about the loaded schema — relationships, what a table is for, or ask it to write a T-SQL or LINQ query. Runs against your own Ollama instance; nothing is sent anywhere else.</span> — Toggle features.</p>
                    <div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" /> <label class="form-check-label">Feature X</label></div>
                </div>


                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab4" role="tabpanel">
                    <p><span style="color:var(--cu-neon-cyan); font-weight:600;">Sends each selected table's column list (names + SQL types only — no data) to Ollama and asks it to suggest clearer C# names where the mechanical PascalCase result is genuinely unclear, plus short doc comments. Nothing is auto-applied — review and tick per table.</span> — Toggle features.</p>
                    <div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" /> <label class="form-check-label">Feature X</label></div>
                </div>

                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab5" role="tabpanel">
                    <p><span style="color:var(--cu-neon-cyan); font-weight:600;">Flags columns that look like foreign keys by naming convention (e.g. CustomerId) but have no real FK constraint in the database. Purely deterministic name + type matching — instant, and more trustworthy here than an LLM guess. Accept only the ones you know are real; accepted ones get a normal navigation property + Fluent config, same as a real FK would.</span> — Toggle features.</p>
                    <div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" /> <label class="form-check-label">Feature X</label></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab6" role="tabpanel">
                    <p><span style="color:var(--cu-neon-cyan); font-weight:600;">Generate Configuration</span> — Toggle features.</p>
                    <div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" /> <label class="form-check-label">Feature X</label></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab7" role="tabpanel">
                    <p><span style="color:var(--cu-neon-cyan); font-weight:600;">Results</span> — Toggle features.</p>
                    <div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" /> <label class="form-check-label">Feature X</label></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

      
        <div>
            <ul class="nav nav-pills" id="pillTab" role="tablist">
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link active" id="pill1-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pill1" type="button" role="tab">News</button>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="pill2-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pill2" type="button" role="tab">Updates</button>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="pill3-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pill3" type="button" role="tab">Alerts</button>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
                    <button class="nav-link" id="pill4-tab" data-bs-toggle="pill" data-bs-target="#pill4" type="button" role="tab">Messages</button>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <div class="tab-content pt-2">
                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="pill1" role="tabpanel">
                    <div class="pill-content" id="pill1">
                        <strong>News</strong> — Latest updates from your team. Click a pill to see different content.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pill2" role="tabpanel"><strong>Updates</strong> — v2.4.1 released.</div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pill3" role="tabpanel"><strong>Alerts</strong> — No critical alerts.</div>
                <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pill4" role="tabpanel"><strong>Messages</strong> — 3 unread.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

